  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan pulls Crocodile Strength Gu from a hundred beast king crocodile corpse after Bai Ning Bing kills the Grand Crocodile king. The same corpse also yields Carapace Gu. He refines both at once. The translation sometimes spells the loot name “Crcocodile Strength Gu.”",
        "chapters": [
          204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "gu_carapace_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the Shang clan city stretch, while Wei Yang argues against the strength path, Fang Yuan lists crocodile strength Gu with black and white boar Gu among the Gu that permanently increased his strength. Wei Yang answers that crocodile strength Gu gave him the strength of a crocodile, and that such Gu are expensive permanent-strength investments. The same talk frames punches and kicks as wasting most of a vat of stored strength, and names that waste as the greatest weakness of the strength path while counting Fang Yuan’s two-boar and one-crocodile strength.",
        "chapters": [
          280
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "strength-path-mention",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_wei_yang",
          "path_strength"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Crocodile strength Gu, brown bear innate strength Gu, and black and white boar Gu each hold Great Dao law fragments of physical strength. That strength lurks in Fang Yuan’s body as beast phantoms until he unleashes their true power, and those phantoms are the visible form of physical-strength Dao marks.",
        "chapters": [
          292
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "beast-phantoms",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_brown_bear_innate_strength_gu",
          "sys_dao_marks"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On San Cha mountain, Fang Yuan upgrades boar strength into thunder boar strength with Thunderclap Gu, all-out effort Gu, and strength qi Gu, then finishes rock crocodile strength the same night. Those upgrades raise his battle strength by at least thirty percent.",
        "chapters": [
          353
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rock-crocodile-strength",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "gu_all_out_effort_gu",
          "gu_strength_qi_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
